### peer_identity
Emitted when a peer completes authentication handshake.
Fields: type, ts, seq, node_id, peer_type, did, short_did, username

### subscriber_state
Emitted after a peer subscribes to a page, showing their authorization snapshot.
Fields: type, ts, seq, page_id, peer_did, short_did, peer_role, authorized_layers, total_layers, can_see_others, is_visible

### broadcast_decision
Emitted when a broadcast is SKIPPED for a subscriber (not on success).
Fields: type, ts, seq, page_id, layer, layer_short, decision, reason, target_did, short_did

### message_trace (enhanced)
Now includes optional page_id and layer_name for sync protocol messages.
Fields: type, ts, seq, direction, msg, node_id, peer_node_id, page_id (optional), layer_name (optional)

### layer_auth (enhanced)
Now includes seq, short_did, and optional pending_count.
